{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Van Wheel Gone</strong> is a whimsical adventure platformer where you play as a little orange van on a quest to recover its stolen wheels from the depths of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a surreal journey through <strong>9 unique hellish environments</strong>, each filled with challenges, enemies, and secrets to uncover. Along the way, you\u2019ll collect powerful items that help you survive and progress:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2702\ufe0f <strong>Scissors</strong> \u2013 slice through demons standing in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Headlight</strong> \u2013 banish the mist and reveal hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 <strong>Clock</strong> \u2013 speed up time to outwit obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udebd <strong>Flight ability</strong> \u2013 soar past hazards and explore new areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a mix of exploration, light combat, and quirky storytelling, <i>Van Wheel Gone</i> offers a one-of-a-kind adventure about courage, persistence, and a van who just wants its wheels back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to roll into hell and bring them home?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941700/extras/286f2725756e86949eac6f2af1e9ec20.avif?t=1756490614\" data-has-big width=1560 height=649 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941700/extras/a5b5b54ca1b68e8a880034179a1a59ea.avif?t=1756490614\" data-has-big width=1560 height=651 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941700/extras/862197eb1e4c3bdfe55ab6cccf1b9e4e.avif?t=1756490614\" data-has-big width=1560 heigh